:name: STM32F103 (bare chip)
:description: rtoos firmware on an STM32F103xB, console USART1. Set $bin to the ELF to run.

$name?="stm32f103"
$bin?=@build/arm-f103/apps/stm32f103/f103_selftest.elf

using sysbus
mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/stm32f103.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x08000000
"""
runMacro $reset
